                    Senior Review Group Meetings Minutes, Originals, 1970. Top Secret; Nodis. The meeting took place in the Situation
                    Room of the White House.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d51-f2" n="2" xml:id="d51-f2-content">
                <p>For a summary of the response to NSSM 99 and a
                    description of the strategies, see <ref target="#d39">Document 39</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d51-f3" n="3" xml:id="d51-f3-content">
                <p>Section 506 of the Foreign Assistance Act of 1961 granted the President special
                    emergency authority to drawdown inventory and equipment for the Department of
                    Defense.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
